{"3077060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kingdom Heroes：Arena", "steam_appid": 3077060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest fighting game in the <i>Kingdom Heroes</i> series is about to take the stage — enter the arena and prove your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest entry in the Kingdom Heroes series marks a bold new evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdom Heroes: Arena breaks away from traditional large-scale strategy and brings the Three Kingdoms battlefield to the fighting arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous generals like Guan Yu, Lu Bu, and Zhao Yun now clash in fierce one-on-one duels, showcasing their signature weapons, explosive skills, and unstoppable combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Epic Weapon Duels of the Three Kingdoms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroes of an age of war have gathered — Xiahou Dun, Xun Yu, Guan Yu, Lu Bu, Sun Shangxiang, Diao Chan, and more — each armed with their legendary weapons and unique fighting styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axes, swords, halberds, spears — every weapon delivers a different rhythm and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lifelike animations and an exhilarating combo system, experience the most thrilling Three Kingdoms battlefield ever reimagined for one-on-one combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/a3f62dcca2bd0ac60fe5b5e6d81679f0.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=572 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/a3f62dcca2bd0ac60fe5b5e6d81679f0.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/a3f62dcca2bd0ac60fe5b5e6d81679f0.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Simple Controls, Fierce Impact</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No intricate input lists, no fighting-game fatigue — just pure weapon combat that's easy to pick up and hard to put down.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chain attacks into seamless, powerful combos and feel every strike land with weight, speed, and precision. Flashy moves, fluid motion, and grounded animations bring every duel to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/be2dc08560d1b22ccca2047bad3b0399.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=636 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/be2dc08560d1b22ccca2047bad3b0399.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/be2dc08560d1b22ccca2047bad3b0399.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The 3D side-view battle system introduces free sidestep movement, creating dynamic offensive and defensive exchanges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Newcomers can jump right in, while veterans will discover incredible depth through small details. Every fight is a test of reflex, strategy, and rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/cf1566b0292fd4845e0d2f2561331491.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/cf1566b0292fd4845e0d2f2561331491.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/cf1566b0292fd4845e0d2f2561331491.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Dual Weapons for Dynamic Battle Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each general can equip two weapons — switch between them instantly to shift tactics mid-battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon offers distinct reach, tempo, and combo potential, giving you freedom to craft your own signature fighting style and adapt to any opponent on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/ba30dde1b64104dda69d215745989341.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/ba30dde1b64104dda69d215745989341.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/ba30dde1b64104dda69d215745989341.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Ultimate Reversals with Super Finishers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the battle reaches its breaking point, unleash your Super Finisher to turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a simple command, trigger a devastating cinematic strike that embodies your warrior's spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension, the flash, and the impact — and deliver the ultimate reversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/7472f76a4088fe02d309e25479f81370.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/7472f76a4088fe02d309e25479f81370.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/7472f76a4088fe02d309e25479f81370.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest fighting game in the <i>Kingdom Heroes</i> series is about to take the stage — enter the arena and prove your strength!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The latest entry in the Kingdom Heroes series marks a bold new evolution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdom Heroes: Arena breaks away from traditional large-scale strategy and brings the Three Kingdoms battlefield to the fighting arena!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Famous generals like Guan Yu, Lu Bu, and Zhao Yun now clash in fierce one-on-one duels, showcasing their signature weapons, explosive skills, and unstoppable combos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Epic Weapon Duels of the Three Kingdoms</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The heroes of an age of war have gathered — Xiahou Dun, Xun Yu, Guan Yu, Lu Bu, Sun Shangxiang, Diao Chan, and more — each armed with their legendary weapons and unique fighting styles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axes, swords, halberds, spears — every weapon delivers a different rhythm and feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lifelike animations and an exhilarating combo system, experience the most thrilling Three Kingdoms battlefield ever reimagined for one-on-one combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi