h through small details. Every fight is a test of reflex, strategy, and rhythm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/cf1566b0292fd4845e0d2f2561331491.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=546 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/cf1566b0292fd4845e0d2f2561331491.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/cf1566b0292fd4845e0d2f2561331491.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Dual Weapons for Dynamic Battle Styles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each general can equip two weapons — switch between them instantly to shift tactics mid-battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every weapon offers distinct reach, tempo, and combo potential, giving you freedom to craft your own signature fighting style and adapt to any opponent on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/ba30dde1b64104dda69d215745989341.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/ba30dde1b64104dda69d215745989341.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/ba30dde1b64104dda69d215745989341.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >■ Ultimate Reversals with Super Finishers</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the battle reaches its breaking point, unleash your Super Finisher to turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a simple command, trigger a devastating cinematic strike that embodies your warrior's spirit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the tension, the flash, and the impact — and deliver the ultimate reversal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/7472f76a4088fe02d309e25479f81370.poster.avif?t=1778549471\" width=1170 height=544 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/7472f76a4088fe02d309e25479f81370.webm?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/extras/7472f76a4088fe02d309e25479f81370.mp4?t=1778549471\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Kingdom Heroes: Arena transforms the Three Kingdoms into an intense weapon-fighting arena! Join epic duels where Guan Yu and Lu Bu unleash powerful combos and special moves. Break free from strategy battles — master your rhythm and prove who truly reigns supreme!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Korean<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/c1eb6a815a76b86ee60a4a3554e4c4f28566a7b7/header.jpg?t=1778549471", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/30b288849f8e9bef6fb69d2c366006c0b03ff3e9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778549471", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3077060/30b288849f8e9bef6fb69d2c366006c0b03ff3e9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778549471", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><b